{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\uddea <strong>ABOUT THE DEMO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This demo lets you experience the full chaos loop \u2014 from cargo reception to total meltdown.  <br>You\u2019ll play in <strong>one fully operational station</strong>, managing <strong>a single galactic sector</strong>  <br>with <strong>the complete gameplay cycle</strong> already in place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Up to <strong>4 players in co-op</strong>, handling incoming shipments, fighting fires,  <br>flushing radioactive llamas, and trying (and failing) to stay organized.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>All core systems are active</strong> \u2014 scanning, decontamination, gravity control, warp dispatch, and more!<br><br>One station is more than enough to understand why you don\u2019t make it past your first shift in <i>Space Chaos</i>. \ud83d\ude80  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097960/extras/6034eb0b1eb946e77fcc8f64eb1c5ea4.avif?t=1760431673\" data-has-big width=1560 height=410 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br>\ud83d\udea8 <strong>INTERGALACTIC CHAOS, CO-OP STYLE</strong> \ud83d\udea8 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>THE MOST DANGEROUS JOB IN THE GALAXY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097960/extras/3fb766c3864a5aa82bf721230982be64.poster.avif?t=1760431673\" width=560 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097960/extras/3fb766c3864a5aa82bf721230982be64.webm?t=1760431673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your station receives cargo nonstop: screaming llamas, leaking dark matter,  <br>radioactive cubes\u2026 or things that definitely move when you\u2019re not looking.  <br><br><strong>Scan them, decontaminate them, reroute them \u2014 or deal with the chaos.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FROM ZERO TO SPACE LEGEND</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097960/extras/b3075e8b190a8e88909f958c29e7b9a6.poster.avif?t=1760431673\" width=560 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097960/extras/b3075e8b190a8e88909f958c29e7b9a6.webm?t=1760431673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Earn galactic reputation, unlock new zones, and customize your station with the  <br>dumbest upgrades known to spacekind.  <br><br><strong>Face absurd run modifiers like solar flares or low-gravity madness.</strong>  <br><strong>No shift is ever the same!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>TEAMWORK OVER IMPLOSION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097960/extras/fbee97c221935bd4e86865c854df1992.poster.avif?t=1760431673\" width=560 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097960/extras/fbee97c221935bd4e86865c854df1992.webm?t=1760431673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Fires. Gravity failures. Vortex malfunctions. You\u2019ll need to work together,  <br>shout orders, and maybe even shower mid-run to stay alive.  <br><br><strong>No one survives alone in Space Chaos!</strong>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097960/extras/e9d68a711257151c1cafbc164ee2b494.poster.avif?t=1760431673\" width=105 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097960/extras/e9d68a711257151c1cafbc164ee2b494.webm?t=1760431673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4097960?t=1760431673","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4097960?t=1760431673","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097960/559fa36f8573c2a276b33bab70b2e1e294187798/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760431673","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097960/559fa36f8573c2a276b33bab70b2e1e294187798/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760431673","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\uddea <strong>ABOUT THE DEMO</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This demo lets you experience the full chaos loop \u2014 from cargo reception to total meltdown.  <br>You\u2019ll play in <strong>one fully operational station</strong>, managing <strong>a single galactic sector</strong>  <br>with <strong>the complete gameplay cycle</strong> already in place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Up to <strong>4 players in co-op</strong>, handling incoming shipments, fightin